---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Tutor Mentor Connect" description="Explore Tutor Mentor Connect: a Back2School Africa online learning ecosystem for tutoring, languages, study resources and professional mentorship.">
  <section class="page-hero tmc-page-hero"><div class="wrap narrow"><span class="eyebrow light">Tutor Mentor Connect</span><h1>A connected place to learn and grow.</h1><p class="lead">An online learning ecosystem bringing primary, high-school and tertiary learners closer to tutors, study resources and professional mentors.</p><a class="button gold" href="#explore">Explore what it brings together <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="explore"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">Learning support</span><h2>Subjects that meet real needs.</h2></div><p>From foundational learning to higher-level study, Tutor Mentor Connect brings subject support into one connected space.</p></div><div class="subject-grid">{['Maths','Mathematical Literacy','Physical Sciences','Life Sciences','English','Economics','Accounting','History','Geography','Coding'].map(subject => <span>{subject}</span>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section wash"><div class="wrap two-col"><div><span class="eyebrow">Languages</span><h2>More ways to understand, express and connect.</h2></div><div><h3>South African language support</h3><p class="language-list">Sepedi · isiZulu · isiXhosa · Setswana · Tshivenda · Xitsonga · Afrikaans · Sesotho</p><h3>International language support</h3><p class="language-list">Including French · German · Mandarin · Spanish</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">Beyond the lesson</span><h2>People, resources and community.</h2></div><p>Learning grows through access to knowledge and to people who can help make sense of what comes next.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span><h3>Professional mentorship</h3><p>Connect with professional perspectives, including examples such as doctors, lawyers and accountants.</p></article><article><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span><h3>Study resources</h3><p>Study notes and shared learning materials to support independent practice.</p></article><article><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><h3>Connected learning</h3><p>Voice rooms, community learning and digital campuses are part of the ecosystem vision.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section tmc-note"><div class="wrap two-col"><div><span class="eyebrow light">How to take part</span><h2>Find your place in the ecosystem.</h2></div><div><p>Learners and parents can explore the support areas. Tutors and mentors can learn how to contribute. The website does not yet offer registration, bookings or access to digital campuses.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button gold" href="/get-involved/">See participation paths <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{siteConfig.tutorMentorConnectUrl && <a class="text-link light-link" href={siteConfig.tutorMentorConnectUrl}>Visit the learning platform ↗</a>}</div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
